# Gitflow

- Default integration branch: `develop`. Production: `master`.
- Never commit feature work directly to `master` or `develop`.
- New work: `feature/<short-name>` from latest `develop`.
- Hotfixes: `hotfix/<short-name>` from `master`, merge back to `master` and `develop`.
- Releases: `release/x.y` from `develop` when preparing a deployable cut.
- Open PRs into `develop` (features) or `master` (release/hotfix). Prefer small PRs.
- Do not create commits or push unless the user asks.
- Do not use `--force` on `master`/`develop`, `--no-verify`, or interactive rebase.
- After meaningful code changes: run `graphify update .` (AST-only).
